# Allowlist: ignore everything, then un-ignore only files that are safe to publish.
# Anything new stays private until it is added here on purpose.
*
!.gitignore
!README.md
!LICENSE
!requirements.txt
!isdt.py
!estimator.py
!notify.py
!ha_live.py
!isdt_gui.py
!isdt_monitor.py

!homeassistant/
!homeassistant/dashboard.yaml

!esp32/
!esp32/README.md
!esp32/isdt_charger/
!esp32/isdt_charger/isdt_charger.ino
!esp32/isdt_charger/charger.h
!esp32/isdt_charger/estimator.h
!esp32/isdt_charger/ha_client.h
!esp32/isdt_charger/net.h
!esp32/isdt_charger/ca_certs.h
!esp32/isdt_charger/secrets.example.h

# Never publish, even if someone edits the list above:
# esp32/isdt_charger/secrets.h  (Home Assistant token, Wi-Fi passwords)
# esp32/build/                  (firmware with the secrets compiled in)
# app_id.txt, *_config.json, estimator_history.json  (personal / machine-specific)
